Viśvāmitra praises Ikṣvāku and Vidēha lineages --- Viśvāmitra seeks Kuśadhvaja daughters for Bharata and Śatrughna --- Janaka consents and assigns brides to both princes --- Janaka fixes one wedding day under Uttara Phalgunī --- Janaka honors sages and yields household authority --- Daśaratha takes leave to perform śrāddha rites --- Daśaratha performs gōdāna gifting lakhs of gold-horned cows